flowchart TD
    ISO["ISO/IEC 27001:2022<br/>ISO/IEC 20000-1:2018"]:::external

    ISO --> InfoSec["Information Security Policy"]:::policy
    ISO --> AccessCtrl["Access Control Policy"]:::policy
    ISO --> ThirdParty["Third-Party Management Policy"]:::policy

    InfoSec --> CMProc["Change Management Procedure"]:::procedure
    InfoSec --> EngOps["Engineering Operation Procedures"]:::procedure
    AccessCtrl --> SDLC["SDLC Guidelines"]:::procedure
    InfoSec --> IncMgmt["Incident Management Procedure"]:::procedure

    CMProc --> LinearTpl["Linear Change template<br/>INT-251"]:::exec
    CMProc --> ArchReview["Runbook: Architecture Review"]:::runbook
    EngOps --> PRs["GitHub PRs<br/>+ staging validation"]:::exec

    LinearTpl --> RetroCR["Q1 2026 Infra Rebuild<br/>retro CR"]:::q1
    PRs --> RetroCR
    ArchReview -. triggers .-> RetroCR
    RetroCR --> CABMin["CAB minutes"]:::exec
    CABMin --> DataRoom[("Normain data room")]:::exec

    RetroCR -. gap plus fix .-> FixPlan["change-mgmt-fix-plan.md"]:::q1
    FixPlan -. update .-> CMProc
    FixPlan -. update .-> EngOps

